     1887                                 v-parts_road-tax-rubl                         @ ub.price-list.price-sale
     1888                                 ub.parts.fact-qnty * ub.parts.road-tax-rubl   @ v-new-sum                sym1 sym6
     1889           with frame Akt-Cost .
