     1907                           ( v-price-list_doc-qnty        * v-price-list_price-sale_new )       @ v-new-sum
     1908                     100 * ( v-price-list_price-sale_diff / v-price-list_price-sale_old )
     1909                                                         when v-price-list_price-sale_old <> 0  @ v-up-fact sym6
     1910             with frame Akt.
     1911             down stream AktStr 1 with frame Akt.
